Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UndergroundParkingLaneFollowing" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :description "Vehicle following another vehicle in a narrow underground parking lane with limited visibility" ;
    :hasObstacle :obstacle1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2, :risk3 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:obstacle1 a :RoadObject ;
    :description "Vehicle directly ahead in the same lane" .

:weather1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of rear-end collision due to close proximity to the vehicle ahead" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "High occlusion risk due to limited visibility in underground parking structure" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:risk3 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Potential lane intrusion risk due to narrow lane width and vehicle proximity" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev3 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.9"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.85"^^xsd:float .

:sev3 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle in the foreground" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Vehicle directly ahead in the same lane" .
```

Identified Risks for each risk class:

**Risk 1:**
Description: High risk of rear-end collision due to close proximity to the vehicle ahead.
Severity Score: 0.9

**Risk 2:**
Description: High occlusion risk due to limited visibility in underground parking structure.
Severity Score: 0.85

**Risk 3:**
Description: Potential lane intrusion risk due to narrow lane width and vehicle proximity.
Severity Score: 0.75